{"title":"1605.00391 Recovery of non-linear cause-effect relationships from linearly mixed neuroimaging data","markdown":{"headingText":"1605.00391 Recovery of non-linear cause-effect relationships from linearly mixed neuroimaging data","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Sebastian Weichwald, Arthur Gretton, Bernhard Schölkopf, Moritz Grosse-Wentrup；2016-05-02（v2 2016-09-30）；arXiv:1605.00391，发表于 PRNI 2016\n- **一句话定位**：把线性 MERLiN 算法扩展为非线性 MERLiN，直接从 EEG 电极记录的线性混合信号中恢复与给定目标变量存在非线性因果关系的大脑源信号，无需先做源定位。\n- **研究问题**：标准因果推断方法要求变量即因果对象，但 EEG 电极测到的是皮层源的瞬时线性叠加；先做源定位会引入建模误差且使维度增大约两个数量级。能否跳过源定位，直接从线性混合 F=AC 中恢复某个给定变量 C1 的（可能是非线性的）因果效应变量？\n- **模型与方法**：基于结构方程模型（SEM）X_i=f_i(PA_i,N_i)与干预 do(·)定义因果，假设忠实性（faithfulness）与马尔可夫性使 d-分离与条件独立一一对应。设定：刺激变量 S 只通过 C1 间接影响 C2（S→C1→…→C_i，且 GS 中无指向 S 的边，可由随机化保证），允许可有隐变量；观测 F=[F_1,…,F_d]^T=AC。目标是找单位向量 w 使 Y_w=w^T F 等于 C1 的某个效应 aC_i。依据因果推断规则：若 C_i ⊥ S|C_1 且 Y ⫫ C_1，则存在因果路径 C1→C_i。据此构造目标函数 max_w dep(C1,Y_w) − dep(S,Y_w|C1)；线性版用偏相关，非线性版用 HSIC 度量边际依赖、用核岭回归（高斯核，宽度 |σ|、岭参数 |θ| 一并优化）的残差 R_w,σ,θ 结合 HSIC 度量条件依赖，即 Y_w − r(C1) ⊥ (S,C1) 蕴含 S ⊥ Y_w|C1；样本三折分区防过拟合，Theano 自动微分加 Pymanopt 流形最速下降求解。应用于 EEG 时因 log 带宽功率与线性组合不可交换，取 Y_w=logbp(w^T F_e)、C1=logbp(v^T F_e)（Hanning 窗后取频段平均 log 带宽功率）。\n- **主要命题/定理**：无编号定理，核心是上述因果推断规则（来自 Grosse-Wentrup et al. 2016 的 SCI 工具变量方法）与非线性目标函数。实验：神经反馈 EEG 数据（3 名被试×2 会话，每会话 60 试次×60 秒，55–85 Hz γ-带功率为反馈信号），按 10–20 系统选 33 导联，恢复结果经头皮拓扑（a∝Σw）与 dSPM 映射为 15028 个偶极子的参与向量后与穷举搜索法比较：非线性与线性 MERLiN 结果高度一致，均支持\"内侧前额叶皮层（MPC）的 γ-振荡是右上顶叶皮层（SPC）γ-振荡的因果效应\"这一 TMS 假设；仅穷举搜索额外发现前中额回。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：属于\"因果变量构造\"方向——当因果对象本身是观测变量的线性组合时，用统计（条件）独立性直接优化出因果变量；是线性 MERLiN（arXiv:1512.01255）与基于工具变量的 SCI 方法的非线性推广，也给出经验证据：在 EEG 单频段内线性方法已足够。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1605.00391.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibtex":"BibTeX","appendix-view-license":"查看许可协议","title-block-author-single":"作者","title-block-author-plural":"作者","title-block-affiliation-single":"单